{
  "$comment": "A validation target hosted by OpenEPCIS DPP-Ready for the older BatteryPass-Ready upload format (data model 1.0, attribute longlist v1.3). GEFEG's published static schemas require nothing; these schemas are DERIVED by OpenEPCIS from what the live GEFEG validator enforced on 2026-06-17 (extensions/eu/battery/validation/gefeg-live/README.md), not a publisher artifact. The fixtures are OpenEPCIS's exports (scripts/export-batterypass-gefeg.ts).",
  "id": "bpr",
  "version": "1.3",
  "title": "BatteryPass-Ready upload format 1.3 (derived from the live GEFEG validator)",
  "publisher": "BatteryPass-Ready consortium (GEFEG); schemas derived by OpenEPCIS",
